#solution[
  Best-First搜索策略：
  - 使用评估函数f(n)估计从n到目标的最优代价
  - 每次选择f(n)最小的节点扩展
  - 使用优先队列维护待扩展节点
  
  伪代码：
  ```
  BestFirstSearch(initial_state):
      open_list = PriorityQueue()
      open_list.push(initial_state, f(initial_state))
      closed_list = {}
      
      while not open_list.empty():
          current = open_list.pop()
          if is_goal(current):
              return current
          closed_list.add(current)
          
          for neighbor in get_neighbors(current):
              if neighbor not in closed_list:
                  open_list.push(neighbor, f(neighbor))
      
      return failure
  ```
]

